# AI Studio platform

This repo authors **skills and prompts** for Presidio AI Studio. Deal work runs
in Studio `/workspace/`. Locally: `.workspace/`.

| Studio | This repo |
|--------|-----------|
| `/workspace/` | `.workspace/` |
| `/skills/user/<skill>/` | `skills/<skill>/` |
| `/code_output/` | `.workspace/code_output/` |

- **Prompt** (`agents/*.md`): identity, purpose, success, audience. Lean.
- **Skill** (`skills/<name>/`): workflows, scripts, schemas. Zip root is
  `<name>/SKILL.md`. Never put the prompt in the zip.
- Sandbox: Python 3.12, Node 20, Bash. Prefer preinstalled packages. No ad-hoc
  pip. ~10 min per run. Scripts read `/workspace/`, write `/workspace/` or
  `/code_output/`. Never write `/skills/`.
